# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Third-party skills installed into this directory.
#
# These live here so Claude Code can load them, but they are other people's
# work under their own licenses and are NOT redistributed by this repo. They
# are installed from their upstreams (see README "Third-party skills"), most
# of them as symlinks into ~/.agents/skills/.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
agent-browser/
claude-api/
inversion/
lateral/
polish/
six-hats/

# Anthropic's plugin marketplace manifest, left over from when this directory
# was a clone of anthropics/skills. Theirs, not mine.
.claude-plugin/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Local scratch and tool state — never publish.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# de-vibe eval scratch: nested git fixtures (which would push as broken
# gitlinks) plus a deliberately fake .env used as detection bait.
de-vibe-workspace/

# launch skill scratch output.
launch-workspace/

# Local state written by MCP tooling.
.dashclaw-local/
.offlocal/

# Skills that `declick setup` generates from the adapters on this machine
# (one per adapter, marked "Generated by declick"). They carry local paths and
# regenerate from ~/.declick, so they are machine state, not skills to share.
agentcash-mcp/
c7/
chrome-devtools/
context7-mcp/
countries/
crm/
dashclaw-mcp/
declick/
fs/
ghcli/
github/
offlocal/
ov/
playwright-mcp/
repowise-mcp/
wx/
xapi/

# Dependencies a skill installs for its own scripts.
node_modules/

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Secrets — belt and braces. Nothing in this repo should ever need them.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.pem
*.key
